-- Printing errors of «مختصر النصيحة» (10th revised edition) corrected (#224).
-- The owner ruled that the app does not follow a typo in the book: it writes
-- the correct form, and each typo goes to the publisher in docs/book-errata.md.
-- Each statement changes only the typo itself; wording, order, footnotes and
-- deliberate spellings stay as printed. `search` is rebuilt with
-- build_search(body) wherever body changes.

